<p>jisdam nagin-e khaatim-e paighambaraa'n giraa<br />
rounaq uthi zamee'n se imaam-e zamaa'n giraa<br />
girne pa sab giroh liye barchiyaa'n giraa<br />
hae hae na in jafaao'n pa bhi aasmaa'n giraa</p>

<p>zehra se poochiye ye qalaq noor-e ain ka<br />
tapna zamee'n ka aur tadapna hussain ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mushtaaq-e ser-e zibha bade afsaraan-e kee'n<br />
qaatil kayi khade huwe aakar qaree'n qaree'n<br />
koi pukaara haa'n koi bola abhi nahi<br />
ab der kya hai sajde me rakh lene do jabee'n</p>

<p>awaaz di umar ne hai gardan dhali huwi<br />
qaatil pukaara aankh abhi hai khuli huwi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sab tham gaye magar na thama shimr -e bad shiyam<br />
sar peetne ki jaa hai rakha us jaga qadam<br />
seena daba to aur bhi tadpe shah-e umam<br />
shor-o fughaa'n suna isi haalat me dam badam</p>

<p>qaatil se poocha dekh kidhar ghul ye hota hai<br />
hai hai hussain ke koi ran me rota hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wo bola koi hoga mai dekhoo'n bhala kidhar<br />
ab tegh par nigaah hai sheh rag pa hai nazar<br />
haa'n jab sawaar hone laga tha mai seene par<br />
saidaani ek qaime se nikli thi nange sar</p>

<p>is dam hamaari fouj me to eid hoti hai<br />
mujh ko yaqeen hai ye wahi bibi roti hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shah bole aur koi nahi ye bahen bahen<br />
aashiq bahen hussain ki tashna dahan bahen<br />
bhooli hamaare pyaar me maa ka chalan bahen<br />
balwa kahaa'n, kahaa'n ye meri qasthatan bahen</p>

<p>qaatil pukaara aage bhi baahar ye aayi thi<br />
sheh bole jab sinaa'n yeh ali akbar ne khaayi thi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aage hai wo maqaam ke ghash honge mominee'n<br />
ye saamne hussain hai wo zainab-e hazee'n<br />
gardan pa tegh dil me sinaa'n seene par laee'n<br />
zainab ye haal dekhti hai aur bas nahi'n</p>

<p>na mehrumo'n ka dhyaan na parde ka hosh hai<br />
ye sab lahu ka josh hai ulfat ka josh hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>wo rona bekasi ka wo ghabraana yaas ka<br />
wo thartaraana dil ka wo udna hawaas ka<br />
kehna bilak bilak ke ye kalma hiras ka<br />
aye shimr waasta ali asghar ki pyaas ka</p>

<p>lillah teen roz ke pyaase ko chod de<br />
sadqa nabi ka unke nawaase ko chod de<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tham jaa quda ko maan habeeb-e quda ko maan<br />
zehra ko maan hazrat-e mushkil kushaa ko maan<br />
saugand faqr-e faaqa-e aal-e abaa ko maan<br />
apni rasool zaadi ki tu iltejaa ko maan</p>

<p>saare buzurg margaye mujh bad naseeb ke<br />
mera koi nahi hai siwa is ghareeb ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye shimr paas bhai ke aau'n jo tu kahe<br />
zaqmou se jalti ret chudhaou'n jo tu kahe<br />
chadar badan ke neeche bichaau'n jo tu kahe<br />
bekal hai sar mai aake uthau'n jo tu kahe</p>

<p>paani to yaa'n milega na zehra ki jaayi ko<br />
aansu chidak ke hosh meh laaungi bhai ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye shimr mai gale se lagaaloo'n to zibha kar<br />
bhai se milke qaime meh jaaloo'n to zibha kar<br />
kuch dard apne dil ka sunaaloo'n to zibha kar<br />
syed ko qibla roo mai litaaloo'n to zibha kar</p>

<p>paani to bhooke pyase ko aye badqisaal de<br />
hai waqt-e zibha aankho'n pa kapda to daal de<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye shimr tujhko qaaleq-e akbar ka waasta<br />
aye shimr tujhko rooh-e payambar ka waasta<br />
aye shimr tujhko hyder-e safdar ka waasta<br />
aye shimr tujhko nanhe se asghar ka waasta</p>

<p>lillah kar na zibha shah-e mashraqain ko<br />
mai bheek maangti hoon mujhe de hussain ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehte kehte sust huwi dam ulat gaya<br />
sar peet'ti ye rehgayi sar sheh ka kat gaya<br />
yu'n laash par giri ke jigar sab ka phat gaya<br />
baahe'n gale me daalke laasha lipat gaya</p>

<p>maa ki tarha thi aashiq-e shaah-e zaman bahan<br />
ye bhai bhai kehti thi laasha bahan bahan<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>